{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《2026香港小姐競選》湖南外景拍攝如火如荼，師姐陳懿德繼續執行酒店房突擊任務！最新一集來到5號魏欣（Etherine）與11號顏懿菲（Agnes）的房間。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e85bb890-e7b3-4f17-a4bc-5ebf9f37d125.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20263If9N4A8EU1784023819.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e85bb890-e7b3-4f17-a4bc-5ebf9f37d125.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳懿德一入房就發揮銳利眼光，發現Agnes急忙跑到梳化前疑似隱藏物品。在嚴格搜查下，竟於枕頭底找出兩隻粉嫩襪仔，更被同房的Etherine搞笑大爆「好Smelly（臭）」，場面逗趣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">不過真正的驚喜其實藏在行李箱內！Agnes自爆今次行程只帶了半篋日用品，皆因另外半篋全被毛公仔佔據。她隨後從床上及行李箱抱出三隻公仔，當中更有一隻巨型LinaBell，令陳懿德大感驚訝。被問到是否因為掛住屋企而帶公仔同行，Agnes笑言自己睡覺時必須攬住大公仔才有安全感，而另外兩隻則放在床頭做「左右門神」陪伴入眠，盡顯滿滿少女心。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b6943305-5b77-4698-9a59-6d4e5ad38e05.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026Ya86anL42O1784023824.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b6943305-5b77-4698-9a59-6d4e5ad38e05.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">鏡頭一轉，輪到檢查Etherine的行李。她的行裝分類得極為整齊，所有物品均以大大小小的收納袋打包妥當，連陳懿德都對其收納功力讚不絕口。期間，一樽神秘的白色藥瓶引起眾人好奇，Etherine略帶害羞地介紹這是她的「補腦配方」（Brain Health Formula），坦言近期因睡眠不足令腦細胞不夠活躍，加上要努力學習廣東話，深怕大腦「load唔切」而需要進補。陳懿德聽罷搞笑地敲敲她的頭部笑問：「你個腦還好嗎？Are you okay？」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a34cc915-7f1a-4cbe-8023-fc82b30a96c1.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026AxIV5oBcS81784023830.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a34cc915-7f1a-4cbe-8023-fc82b30a96c1.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">在突擊行動尾聲，陳懿德預告晚點隨時會再加碼突襲，甚至要求兩位佳麗直接在鏡頭前落妝示人。面對素顏挑戰，兩人表現得從容大方，直指完全沒問題。性格幽默的Etherine更對着鏡頭大做搞怪表情，又指着自己雙眼自嘲擁有大黑眼圈，展現出貼地可愛的一面。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-17T08:21:09.867596+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":680,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}